Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.00,0:23:54.58,Main,Claris,0,0,0,,Umm... This is the preview of the next episode of \N{\i1}The Iceblade Sorcerer Shall Rule the World{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.99,0:23:58.92,Main,Claris,0,0,0,,Infiltrating Diom! The target is a \Nsmart and beautiful young lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.92,0:24:02.15,Main,Claris,0,0,0,,A very volatile teatime is about to begin!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.15,0:24:06.57,Main,Claris,0,0,0,,"The Girl Who Became the World's Strongest \NSorcerer Infiltrates a Sorcery Academy".
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.46,0:24:09.96,ep title,txt,0,0,0,,Episode 7\N{\fscx75}The Girl Who Became the World's Strongest Sorcerer Infiltrates a Sorcery Academy
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.57,0:24:09.58,Main,Claris,0,0,0,,This was Claris Cleveland!
